{"status":"answered","model_status":"answered","answer":"注册 DSS 的步骤见 Malaysia 校区的资料：先提交带有所需信息的注册材料，DSS 顾问随后会联系您讨论所需的学习调整，您会收到注册确认邮件。该资料仅适用于 Malaysia 校区。","points":[{"text":"注册材料需要来自独立的、有相关领域经验的合格健康专业人员，例如精神科医生、全科医生、物理治疗师、教育心理学家或听力师。","source_id":"my-disability-register#1","quote":"be from an independent qualified health professional who has experience in the relevant field","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"材料中需要清楚说明您的病情、对学业的影响，以及为应对这些影响所建议的支持安排。","source_id":"my-disability-register#2","quote":"clearly state the condition, its impacts on your academic life, and recommendations for accommodations to address these impacts.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"DSS 顾问会联系您，可通过电子邮件、电话或 Zoom 视频讨论所需的学习调整。","source_id":"my-disability-register#2","quote":"A DSS adviser will get in touch with you to talk about any adjustments you may need for your learning.","doc":"my-disability-register","title":"Register with Disability Services","section":"Register with Disability Services","level":null,"campus":"my","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu.my/student-services/support-services/disability-support/register-with-disability-services","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"请尽早注册，因为 DSS 会根据您的情况进行评估，评估过程可能需要一些时间。","source_id":"all-disability-alternative-assessment#2","quote":"The assessment process can take some time, so it’s a good idea to register as early as possible.","doc":"all-disabili